plan.prompt:
Application to build:
{{input.request}}

Produce: requirements, architecture, the list of files/modules, and an ordered implementation plan with acceptance criteria. Do not write code.

implement.prompt:
Request:
{{input.request}}

Plan:
{{steps.plan}}

Implement the application: create and edit the files, add unit tests. Reply with a short summary of what was done.

review.prompt:
Plan:
{{steps.plan}}

Implementation summary:
{{steps.implement}}

Review the code in the project against the plan: correctness, missing parts, security, readability. Start your answer with APPROVED or CHANGES NEEDED, then list the issues.

rework.prompt:
Plan:
{{steps.plan}}

Review findings:
{{steps.review}}

Fix every finding in the project files. Reply with a short summary of the changes.

test.prompt:
Plan:
{{steps.plan}}

Build the application and run all tests (add missing ones for the acceptance criteria). Report the commands run and the results. Start your answer with PASSED or FAILED.

fixtests.prompt:
Test report:
{{steps.test}}

Fix the cause of every failure in the project files. Reply with a short summary.
